..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SAFAKTURA.TAB
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : as
.. Funktion       : Erstellt eine Zeile pro Aufruf,  die Zeilen enthalten
..                  je eine noch zu fakturierende Serviceanfrageposition
.. Functionality  : builds one row ber call, the rows are to be invoiced
..                  service request positions
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. helper for calculating gp3 to real
.type real xrmin ? _F|defined(xrmin)
.type real xrhur ? _F|defined(xrhur)
.type real xrday ? _F|defined(xrday)
..
.select line 'selzeile'
..
.. only show service request row, if it has a duration (no duration -> no invoice)
.continue END     ?  F|empty(H|dauer)
.continue END     ? _F|empty(H|serau)
..
.make screen line +O
.formula   M|tdatum     = H|datum
.formula   M|tanfbearb  = H|tbearbeit^id
.formula   M|tuhrzvon   = H|uhrzvon
.formula   M|tuhrzbis   = H|uhrzbis
.formula   M|trmktxt    = H|tanfbesch
.formula   M|tanfdau    = H|dauer
..
.. calculate real-type hours from GP3 field, e.g. "0D01h00m"
.formula   M|the        = "h"
.formula   T|xrmin      = F|substr('M|tanfdau',-2,-2)
.formula   T|xrhur      = F|substr('M|tanfdau',-5,-2)
.formula   T|xrday      = F|substr('M|tanfdau',-8,-1)
.formula   M|tmge       = 0 + T|xrmin / 60 + T|xrhur + T|xrday * 24
..
.. the row index is needed later to update the invoice number into the service request
.formula   M|tanfzeile  = H|znum
..
.formula   M|tsbufakt = "icon:screen_edit"   ?  F|empty(H|repos)
.continue   SPKOPF                            ?  F|empty(H|repos)
..
.load 0 sales 'H|repos^id'
.continue SPKOPF         ? _T|mehr
.formula   M|tanfrechnr   = 0|id
.load 0
..
!SPKOPF: service request
.select header
.assign M|tanfrage   = H|id
.formula   M|tanfsts    = H|anfstatus
.assign M|tkunde     = H|kunde^id
.assign M|tserprod   = H|serprod^id
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
